  }
  return false;
}
```
Target for summon is the active player's monster. Defender is 1-active. Condition base atk >= 1500. Note target face-down set monster's ATK base still known; triggers; okay but maybe shouldn't. Fine.

`destroyAt` logs and returns inst.

Attack trap:
```js
