```

Destroying a face-down monster: event faceDown true for animation; then push inst to GY with faceDown=false? Set faceDown false before push for visibility? GY display shows face-up. Set inst.faceDown=false after capturing.

Spell zone card destroyed? No effects destroy spells; field replaced. Mirror etc. send to GY.

`sendToGY(p, inst)` clears equipped? no.

Attack resolution:
```js
