But side width equals board width? `width:max-content`, so yes. Lines extending into empty sides at vertical center. Could add bracket caps. This adds tech aesthetic. But maybe too decorative.

Could add vertical label "OPPONENT" / "YOUR FIELD" alongside. Hmm.

Maybe better to add a right-side vertical "ZONE MAP" HUD showing counts (24 zones, 12 each) and phase? Already topbar "NO IMAGE CARD BATTLE · 12 + 12 ZONES", info 24 zones. Enough.

